    "text": "<p>As per the given figure, two blocks each of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>250</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> are connected to a spring of spring constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. If both are given velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math> in opposite directions, then maximum elongation of the spring is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9be38da4-5bff-4329-8ffc-413921cd5f49-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 47px;\" /></p>",
